{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46101","headline":"酬周相公见赠 · 贯休","name":"酬周相公见赠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"三界无家是出家，岂宜拊凤覩新麻。\n幸生白发逢今圣，曾梦青莲映玉沙。\n境陟名山烹锦水，睡忘东白洞平茶。\n喜擎绣段攀金鼎，谢朓余霞始是霞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46101.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46101","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}